ed.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408850/extras/c66fb05987e7cdeefcc45729527464b0.webm?t=1755173605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game system</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full animation with Live2D! Collision detection is set for various parts such as the head, buttocks, chest, thighs, etc. You can easily massage each part by dragging it. Animations are created in real time based on the part, favorability, and your operation!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Likeability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her likability will change by giving her a massage. As the favorability increases, she will accept more extreme massages. In addition, favorability is converted into MASSAGE POINTS, and you can unlock various items and actions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can adjust the various parts that make up the facial expression. Try making the expression to your liking. You can also set steam, pubic hair, and the transparency of the man.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Photo shooting function</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A UI so realistic that it feels like you're taking a sex video with your smartphone. You can choose between PNG and GIF as the save format.</p>",
